const phases={TAKEOFF:'TAKEOFF / 起飞滑跑',CLIMB:'CLIMB / 爬升',CRUISE:'CRUISE / 高空巡航',DESCENT:'DESCENT / 下降',APPROACH:'APPROACH / 最后进近',ROLLOUT:'ROLLOUT / 着陆滑跑'};
function updateFlight(dt){if(!flight||paused)return;const f=flight,oldGate=f.gate;stepFlight(f,keys,dt);if(f.failed){failMission(f.failed);return}if(f.landed){finish();return}if(f.gate>oldGate){gates[oldGate].visible=false;if(gates[f.gate]){gates[f.gate].material.color.set(0xffb84e);gates[f.gate].material.opacity=.9}playChime();message(f.gate===8?'已获降落许可 · 减速，对准跑道缓慢下降':`导航点 ${f.gate} / 8 已通过`)}player.position.set(f.x,f.y,f.z);player.rotation.set(f.pitch,f.yaw,f.bank);player.traverse(o=>{if(o.name==='prop')o.rotation.z+=dt*(15+f.throttle*55)});const cameraTarget=new THREE.Vector3(f.x+Math.sin(f.yaw)*54,f.y+18,f.z+Math.cos(f.yaw)*54);flightCamera.position.lerp(cameraTarget,dt===0?1:Math.min(1,dt*5));flightCamera.lookAt(f.x-Math.sin(f.yaw)*170,f.y+12+Math.sin(f.pitch)*40,f.z-Math.cos(f.yaw)*170);let density=0;for(const c of scenery.clouds){const dist=Math.hypot((f.x-c.x)*.85,(f.y-c.y)*1.5,f.z-c.z);density=Math.max(density,clamp(1-dist/c.r,0,1))}f.cloud+=(density-f.cloud)*Math.min(1,dt*3);$('#cloudVeil').style.opacity=f.cloud*.8;flightScene.fog.near=2200*(1-f.cloud)+80*f.cloud;flightScene.fog.far=11000*(1-f.cloud)+650*f.cloud;flightCamera.position.x+=Math.sin(f.elapsed*13)*f.cloud*.35;
const g=WAYPOINTS[f.gate]||{x:0,y:5,z:-14400};const dx=g.x-f.x,dy=g.y-f.y,dz=g.z-f.z,dist=Math.hypot(dx,dy,dz);$('#phaseBadge').textContent=phases[f.phase];$('#objective').textContent=!f.airborne&&!f.touchedDown?'起飞：速度 > 44 kt，按 W 抬头':f.gate===8?landingGuidance(f):`导航 ${f.gate+1} · 目标高度 ${g.y} m`;$('#flightProgress').textContent=`${f.gate} / 8`;$('#routeBar').style.width=f.gate/8*100+'%';const yawTarget=Math.atan2(-dx,-dz),delta=Math.atan2(Math.sin(yawTarget-f.yaw),Math.cos(yawTarget-f.yaw));$('#navCue').textContent=f.touchedDown?'↓ 收油门，减速至停稳':`${Math.abs(delta)<.07?'航向对正':delta>0?'← 左转':'右转 →'} · ${Math.abs(dy)<45?'保持高度':dy>0?'↑ 爬升':'↓ 下降'} · ${(dist/1000).toFixed(1)} km`;const remain=Math.ceil(f.remaining);$('#countdown').textContent=`${String(Math.floor(remain/60)).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(remain%60).padStart(2,'0')}`;$('#countdown').classList.toggle('urgent',remain<45);$('#speed').textContent=Math.round(f.speed*.97192);$('#speedNeedle').style.transform=`rotate(${-130+clamp(f.speed*.97192/180,0,1)*260}deg)`;$('#altitude').textContent=Math.round(f.y);$('#altNeedle').style.transform=`rotate(${-130+f.y/2400*260}deg)`;$('#horizonDisc').style.transform=`translateY(${f.pitch*80}px) rotate(${-f.bank*180/Math.PI}deg)`;$('#pitchValue').textContent=Math.round(f.pitch*180/Math.PI)+'°';$('#bankValue').textContent=Math.round(f.bank*180/Math.PI)+'°';$('#headingValue').textContent=String(Math.round(headingAt(f.route,f))%360).padStart(3,'0')+'°';$('#vsValue').textContent=(f.verticalSpeed>0?'+':'')+f.verticalSpeed.toFixed(1);$('#throttleValue').textContent=Math.round(f.throttle*100)+'%';$('#throttleBar').style.width=f.throttle*100+'%';$('#remainingDistance').textContent=`DEST ${(Math.hypot(f.x,Math.max(0,f.z+13300))/1000).toFixed(1)} KM · ${f.cloud>.25?'IN CLOUD':'VISUAL'}`;
flightCamera.updateMatrixWorld();const v=new THREE.Vector3(g.x,g.y,g.z).project(flightCamera);const front=new THREE.Vector3(g.x-f.x,g.y-f.y,g.z-f.z).dot(flightCamera.getWorldDirection(new THREE.Vector3()))>0;$('#navigationMarker').style.display=front?'block':'none';$('#navigationMarker').style.left=clamp((v.x*.5+.5)*100,8,92)+'%';$('#navigationMarker').style.top=clamp((-v.y*.5+.5)*100,25,60)+'%';$('#markerText').textContent=f.gate===8?`RWY ${String(Math.round(routePosition(f.route,0,-14400).heading/10)%36||36).padStart(2,'0')}`:`NAV ${f.gate+1} · ${g.y}m`;
let nearby=scenery.landmarks.find(l=>Math.hypot(f.x-l.x,f.z-l.z)<2400);if(nearby){const p=new THREE.Vector3(nearby.x,nearby.y,nearby.z).project(flightCamera);$('#landmarkLabel').style.display=p.z<1&&Math.abs(p.x)<1&&Math.abs(p.y)<1?'block':'none';$('#landmarkLabel').style.left=(p.x*.5+.5)*100+'%';$('#landmarkLabel').style.top=(-p.y*.5+.5)*100+'%';$('#landmarkLabel').textContent=nearby.name}else $('#landmarkLabel').style.display='none';
if(rain){rain.position.set(f.x,f.y-100,f.z);const a=rain.geometry.attributes.position;for(let i=0;i<a.count;i+=2){a.array[i*3+1]-=dt*110;if(a.array[i*3+1]<0)a.array[i*3+1]=250;a.array[(i+1)*3+1]=a.array[i*3+1]-8}a.needsUpdate=true;rain.visible=(cities[city].weather==='小雨'&&f.y<1050)||f.weather.type==='storm'&&f.weather.intensity>.1}updateEnvironment(f,dt);updateAudio();if(f.remaining<30&&Math.floor(f.elapsed)!==Math.floor(f.elapsed-dt)&&Math.floor(f.remaining)%5===0)note(440,.16,.12);}
function updateEnvironment(f,dt){const geo=routePosition(f.route,f.x,f.z),w=f.weather,sea=f.route.samples[Math.round(geo.progress*160)]?.land===false;scenery.waveTime.value=f.elapsed;$('#geoReadout').textContent=`${Math.abs(geo.lat).toFixed(2)}°${geo.lat>=0?'N':'S'} / ${Math.abs(geo.lon).toFixed(2)}°${geo.lon>=0?'E':'W'} · ${sea?'跨海航段':'陆地航段'}`;const card=$('#weatherStatus');card.classList.toggle('weather-danger',w.intensity>.22);$('#weatherName').textContent=w.intensity>.05?`${w.type==='storm'?'⛈':'≋'} ${w.name} · ${w.intensityLabel}扰动`:w.next?`⚠ 前方 ${(Math.abs(f.z-w.next.z)/1000).toFixed(1)} km：${w.next.name}`:'☀ 当前气流平稳';const cell=w.intensity>.05?f.weatherCells.find(c=>c.name===w.name):w.next;$('#weatherAdvice').textContent=cell?`扰动层 ${cell.base}–${cell.top} m · ${f.y>(cell.base+cell.top)/2?'爬升至 '+(cell.top+120)+' m':'下降至 '+Math.max(180,cell.base-120)+' m'}可避让`:'留意高度与姿态，保持安全航速';$('#liftValue').textContent=Math.round(w.lift*100)+'%';$('#gustValue').textContent=`${w.windY>=0?'+':''}${w.windY.toFixed(1)} m/s`;$('#stabilityBar').style.width=clamp(100-Math.abs(f.bank)*55-Math.abs(f.pitch)*30,0,100)+'%';$('#weatherVeil').style.opacity=w.type==='storm'?w.intensity*.45:0;const thunder=w.flash&&!f.lastFlash;if(thunder){note(48,2,.35,effectsBus);note(63,1.5,.2,effectsBus)}f.lastFlash=w.flash;$('#lightningFlash').style.opacity=w.flash?.14:0;scenery.lightning.visible=w.flash;if(w.flash){const c=f.weatherCells.find(c=>c.name===w.name);scenery.lightning.position.set(c.x+180,c.base-350,c.z-160)}const storm=w.type==='storm'?w.intensity:0;flightScene.background.lerp(new THREE.Color(storm>.1?0x657e98:cities[city].weather==='小雨'?0x91b8d2:0x79bce4),Math.min(1,dt*2));flightScene.fog.far=Math.min(flightScene.fog.far,11000*(1-storm)+1100*storm);sun.intensity=2.2-storm*1.5;}
function failMission(reason){mode='result';keys={};$('#resultEyebrow').textContent='FLIGHT INTERRUPTED';$('#resultTitle').textContent=reason;$('#resultText').textContent=reason==='运输超时'?'未在 4 分钟内完成运输。本次不增加里程或经验。':'请按导航点飞行；着陆时保持机翼水平，空速低于 76 kt，下降率低于 15 m/s，随后收油门停稳。';$('#resultStats').textContent=`导航 ${flight.gate} / 8 · 用时 ${Math.round(flight.elapsed)} 秒`;$('#resultClose').textContent='返回基地，重新起飞 ↗';$('#result').showModal();updateAudio();}
function finish(){const f=flight;if(f.credited)return;f.credited=true;const before=planes.filter(p=>save.xp>=p.xp).length;save.xp+=f.mission.xp;save.miles+=f.mission.d;save.jobs++;save.logs.push({from:cities[f.origin].name,to:cities[f.mission.i].name,km:f.mission.d,xp:f.mission.xp,plane:planes[save.plane].name});save.logs=save.logs.slice(-100);persist();renderStats();mode='result';$('#resultEyebrow').textContent='MISSION COMPLETE';$('#resultTitle').textContent='平稳着陆，运输完成。';$('#resultText').textContent=`${f.mission.type}已安全送达${cities[f.mission.i].name}，剩余 ${Math.ceil(f.remaining)} 秒。`+(planes.filter(p=>save.xp>=p.xp).length>before?' 新的飞机已在机库解锁！':'');$('#resultStats').textContent=`+${f.mission.d.toLocaleString()} km　　+${f.mission.xp} XP`;$('#result').showModal();playChime();updateAudio()}
$('#resultClose').onclick=()=>{$('#result').close();$('#flight').classList.add('hidden');mode='lobby';flight=null;resizeAll();updateAudio()};$('#result').addEventListener('cancel',e=>{e.preventDefault();$('#resultClose').click()});
let audioCtx,master,musicBus,effectsBus,windGain,rainGain,engineGain,engineOsc,musicTimer,audioStarted=false;let musicLevel=.65,effectsLevel=.7;
function startAudio(){try{if(!audioCtx){audioCtx=new (window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)();master=audioCtx.createGain();master.gain.value=.6;master.connect(audioCtx.destination);musicBus=audioCtx.createGain();musicBus.connect(master);effectsBus=audioCtx.createGain();effectsBus.connect(master);const buffer=audioCtx.createBuffer(1,audioCtx.sampleRate*3,audioCtx.sampleRate),d=buffer.getChannelData(0);for(let i=0;i<d.length;i++)d[i]=Math.random()*2-1;function noise(type,freq){const source=audioCtx.createBufferSource();source.buffer=buffer;source.loop=true;const filter=audioCtx.createBiquadFilter();filter.type=type;filter.frequency.value=freq;const gain=audioCtx.createGain();source.connect(filter);filter.connect(gain);gain.connect(effectsBus);source.start();return gain}windGain=noise('lowpass',480);rainGain=noise('highpass',1800);engineOsc=audioCtx.createOscillator();engineOsc.type='sawtooth';const filter=audioCtx.createBiquadFilter();filter.type='lowpass';filter.frequency.value=210;engineGain=audioCtx.createGain();engineOsc.connect(filter);filter.connect(engineGain);engineGain.connect(effectsBus);engineOsc.start();let step=0;const melody=[261.63,329.63,392,523.25,493.88,392,329.63,293.66,220,261.63,329.63,440,392,329.63,293.66,261.63];musicTimer=setInterval(()=>{if(muted||paused&&mode==='flight')return;note(melody[step%melody.length],1.2,.24);if(step%4===0){const root=[130.81,110,87.31,98][Math.floor(step/4)%4];[1,1.25,1.5].forEach(r=>note(root*r,2.6,.055))}step++},500)}audioCtx.resume().then(()=>{audioStarted=audioCtx.state==='running';syncAudioButtons();if(!audioStarted)toast('点击飞行界面的声音按钮启用音频。')});updateAudio();syncAudioButtons();}catch{toast('当前浏览器无法启用音频，请使用支持 Web Audio 的浏览器。')}}
function note(freq,duration,volume,bus){if(!audioCtx||muted)return;const osc=audioCtx.createOscillator(),gain=audioCtx.createGain();osc.type='sine';osc.frequency.value=freq;gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0,audioCtx.currentTime);gain.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(volume,audioCtx.currentTime+.025);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audioCtx.currentTime+duration);osc.connect(gain);gain.connect(bus||musicBus);osc.start();osc.stop(audioCtx.currentTime+duration)}
function updateAudio(){if(!audioCtx)return;const active=mode==='flight'&&!paused;master.gain.setTargetAtTime(muted||mode==='flight'&&paused?0:.65,audioCtx.currentTime,.08);musicBus.gain.setTargetAtTime(musicLevel,audioCtx.currentTime,.1);effectsBus.gain.setTargetAtTime(effectsLevel,audioCtx.currentTime,.1);windGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(active?.08+(flight.speed/180)*.25+flight.cloud*.1+flight.weather.intensity*.35:0,audioCtx.currentTime,.15);rainGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(active&&rain?.08*(rain.visible?1:0)+flight.weather.intensity*.14:0,audioCtx.currentTime,.2);engineGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(active?.075+flight.throttle*.08:0,audioCtx.currentTime,.1);engineOsc.frequency.setTargetAtTime(active?40+flight.throttle*55:35,audioCtx.currentTime,.1)}
function playChime(){note(660,.22,.2,effectsBus);setTimeout(()=>note(880,.4,.18,effectsBus),110)}function syncAudioButtons(){$('#sound').textContent=muted?'♫':'♪';$('#sound').title=muted||!audioStarted?'开启音乐与音效':'关闭音乐与音效';$('#sound').setAttribute('aria-label',$('#sound').title);$('#flightSound').textContent=muted?'♫ 声音关闭':audioStarted?'♫ 声音开启':'♫ 点击启用声音'}function toggleSound(){muted=audioStarted?!muted:false;startAudio();syncAudioButtons()}$('#sound').onclick=toggleSound;$('#flightSound').onclick=toggleSound;$('#musicVolume').oninput=e=>{musicLevel=+e.target.value/100;updateAudio()};$('#effectsVolume').oninput=e=>{effectsLevel=+e.target.value/100;updateAudio()};syncAudioButtons();
function resize(r,c,el){const w=el.clientWidth,h=el.clientHeight;if(w&&h){r.setSize(w,h,false);c.aspect=w/h;c.updateProjectionMatrix()}}function resizeAll(){resize(globeRenderer,globeCamera,$('#globe'));resize(previewRenderer,previewCamera,$('#planePreview'));resize(flightRenderer,flightCamera,$('#flightCanvas'))}window.addEventListener('resize',resizeAll);makeTasks();renderStats();resizeAll();let prev=performance.now();function animate(now){requestAnimationFrame(animate);const dt=Math.min((now-prev)/1000,.05);prev=now;if(mode==='flight'||mode==='result'){if(mode==='flight')updateFlight(dt);flightRenderer.render(flightScene,flightCamera)}else if(!$('#dispatch').classList.contains('hidden')){globeRenderer.render(globeScene,globeCamera);globeGroup.updateMatrixWorld();markers.forEach(({m,el},i)=>{const v=m.getWorldPosition(new THREE.Vector3());const visible=v.z>.7&&(i===city||i===tasks[selected].i||v.z>1.5);el.style.display=visible?'block':'none';if(visible){v.project(globeCamera);el.style.left=(v.x*.5+.5)*$('#globe').clientWidth+'px';el.style.top=(-v.y*.5+.5)*$('#globe').clientHeight+'px'}});previewPlane.rotation.y=Math.sin(now*.0003)*.16;previewPlane.position.y=Math.sin(now*.001)*.08;previewRenderer.render(previewScene,previewCamera)}}requestAnimationFrame(animate);
